e-shoulder chiffon dress with its prominent bow. Create a continuous dance storyboard in a precise grid of three equal rows and three equal columns, featuring her as the only performer in a fiery, confident, and elegant solo dance show. Read the panels from left to right and top to bottom. All nine panels take place on the same physically buildable stage with warm gold curtains, a softly reflective floor, and coral-red and amber spotlights. Panel one: the curtain opens and she stands at the center of a spotlight, ready to dance. Panel two: she turns her head toward the camera and raises one arm. Panel three: she takes a strong side step as the chiffon skirt moves with her. Panel four: a medium shot captures a fluid arm sweep and rhythmic turn of her body. Panel five: a full-body view shows a fast spin with the skirt opening naturally. Panel six: a close view captures her confident, engaged expression and moving strands of hair. Panel seven: she performs a graceful low dance step near the front of the stage with natural anatomy. Panel eight: she rises into a powerful turn, with the spotlight and flowing skirt forming a clear arc of motion. Panel nine: she faces the audience and holds a striking final pose. Keep her identity, hairstyle, outfit, jewelry, and stage geography consistent across all nine panels. Vary wide, medium, and close shots with a clear rhythm. Make the choreography sensual and theatrical while keeping the outfit fully worn and the skin, limbs, fingers, and fabric movement physically believable. No other people, titles, captions, panel numbers, logos, or watermarks."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [353.7073059082031, 454.6300964355469], "pos": [-738.9844970703125, 2496.07666015625], "id": 544, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [676], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [270, 270], "pos"